    "title": "Where to watch Purdue vs Miami (FL) in March Madness Second Round: Time, TV Channel",
    "text": "Updated March 22, 2026, 10:19 a.m. ETMarch Madness is underway and college basketball's big dance continues with No. 2 seed Purdue taking on No. 7 seed Miami (FL) in a Second Round matchup on Sunday, March 22. Here's everything you need to know to tune in for the clash between the Hurricanes and Boilermakers.USA TODAY Sports has a team of journalists covering men's March Madness to keep you up to date with every point scored, rebound grabbed and game won in the 68-team tournament.Watch Purdue vs. Miami FREE with FuboWhat time is Miami (FL) vs Purdue Second Round game?No. 2 Purdue vs No. 7 Miami (FL) tips off at 12:10 PM (EST) on Sunday, March 22 from Enterprise Center (St. Louis, Missouri).What channel is Miami (FL) vs Purdue Second Round game?No. 2 Purdue vs No. 7 Miami (FL) is airing live on CBS (watch with Fubo free trial).How to stream Miami (FL) vs Purdue Second Round gameNo. 2 Purdue vs No. 7 Miami (FL) is available to stream on Fubo.Watch Purdue vs. Miami with Fubo free trialMen's March Madness schedule todaySee the schedule, live scores and results for all of Sunday's NCAA Tournament action here.2026 March Madness datesMarch 17-18: First FourMarch 19-20: First RoundMarch 21-22: Second RoundMarch 26-27: Sweet 16March 28-29: Elite 8April 4: Final FourApril 6: National ChampionshipWatch the NCAA Tournament all March long with FuboOur team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.Information in this article was imported automatically into a template written and reviewed by a USA TODAY Sports editor. You can send feedback using this form.",
